[TITLE]
synthetic: [LID_LAYER_TREATMENT], every branch of lidnode::readTreatment and
lidnode::validTreatment (istringstream extraction, treatment::validate messages)

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS CFS
FLOW_ROUTING DYNWAVE

[POLLUTANTS]
TSS MG/L 0 0 0 0 NO * 0 0 0
Lead UG/L 0 0 0 0 NO * 0 0 0

[LID_LAYER_TREATMENT]
Train 2 TSS 50 0 -
Train 2 Late 10 0 -
Nope 1 TSS 10 0 -
Train 2 Ghost 10 0 -

[LID_CONTROLS]
Train NODE
Train SURFACE 6 .1
Train MEDIA 12 .45 .20 .08 5 3 3
Train AGGREGATE 12 .40 100
Train BOTTOM 0 0
Bio BC
Bio SURFACE 6 0.1 0.1 1.0 5
Bio SOIL 12 0.5 0.2 0.1 0.5 10 3.5

[POLLUTANTS]
Late MG/L 0 0 0 0 NO * 0 0 0

